WEBVTT

00:25.640 --> 00:29.280
[Nanno] In a country
where there's no place for the poor…

00:29.360 --> 00:33.280
[whistling
"London Bridge Is Falling Down"]

00:33.360 --> 00:36.080
…and no consequences for the rich…

00:37.160 --> 00:38.920
[lightning crackles]

00:40.400 --> 00:42.840
…it's not the court

00:42.920 --> 00:45.360
who hands you the verdict.

00:49.920 --> 00:53.480
It's the money in your pocket
that decides your fate.

00:55.800 --> 00:59.160
[theme music playing]

02:27.400 --> 02:32.560
I don't think we'll get anywhere
if you don't tell me the truth.

02:32.640 --> 02:34.200
You can keep asking me,

02:34.280 --> 02:37.080
but I swear that I didn't cheat
on my exam.

02:37.160 --> 02:39.120
You're just trying to find
something wrong with me.

02:39.200 --> 02:42.160
As you can see, this is why
I called you here, Mr. Songkiat.

02:42.240 --> 02:44.000
You have no proof whatsoever.

02:44.080 --> 02:46.920
Why don't you just go ahead
and choke a confession out of me?

02:47.440 --> 02:50.120
-There's no need to drag my dad into this.
-[thuds]

02:54.640 --> 02:56.080
Apologize to your principal.

02:57.160 --> 02:58.880
-Dad.
-Minnie.

03:02.320 --> 03:03.360
I'm sorry.

03:06.360 --> 03:07.520
Say it again.

03:08.600 --> 03:10.080
-And mean it.
-[Minnie scoffs]

03:15.400 --> 03:18.120
I'm sorry. Forgive me.

03:25.160 --> 03:29.040
Our school here
takes cheating very seriously.

03:29.120 --> 03:31.840
I know, that's why I'd like to make
a generous donation

03:31.920 --> 03:34.560
to offset my daughter's
unacceptable behavior.

03:38.200 --> 03:40.880
But there will still be consequences
for Minnie.

03:43.160 --> 03:44.040
I understand.

03:44.880 --> 03:45.920
Uh,

03:46.000 --> 03:50.120
should I just make the check
out to you, directly, for your trouble?

03:51.280 --> 03:53.760
[breathes deeply]

03:56.840 --> 03:59.880
Maybe you could clean
the bathrooms this semester.

04:00.880 --> 04:02.720
[principal]
Would you like to do that, Minnie?

04:02.800 --> 04:03.760
[scoffs]

04:08.600 --> 04:09.600
I'd like that.

04:11.520 --> 04:14.840
-[Minnie] Why did you hit me?
-You would've been expelled if I hadn't.

04:14.920 --> 04:16.160
Expel me. I don't care.

04:16.240 --> 04:18.760
But I do.
I don't want to find you a new school.

04:18.840 --> 04:20.840
-Someone must've ratted me out.
-Look.

04:20.920 --> 04:22.600
Can you please stop grumbling?

04:22.680 --> 04:24.600
Haven't you embarrassed me enough?

04:25.840 --> 04:29.320
Hmm, but the principal has no proof.

04:29.400 --> 04:31.360
-How can she punish me?
-Obviously…

04:32.400 --> 04:34.400
you were sloppy
if you got the same answers.

04:34.480 --> 04:35.760
No wonder you got caught.

04:35.840 --> 04:38.280
Don't you think
maybe my friend copied my answers?

04:41.120 --> 04:42.360
I'm not your principal.

04:43.520 --> 04:44.800
You don't have to lie to me.

04:46.320 --> 04:47.960
[Songkiat] I know you.

04:48.040 --> 04:51.560
You never take responsibility
for your mistakes

04:51.640 --> 04:53.320
or anything that you do.

04:57.560 --> 04:58.920
Use your head for once.

05:03.760 --> 05:05.480
I'm gonna take your car away

05:05.560 --> 05:06.800
-and ground you.
-[gasps]

05:06.880 --> 05:07.920
For a month.

05:08.000 --> 05:10.400
And you can't leave the house
after 6:00 p.m.

05:10.480 --> 05:13.080
Are you crazy? You can't do that to me!

05:13.160 --> 05:17.560
I just paid 30 grand
to keep you from getting expelled.

05:18.160 --> 05:19.360
-But--
-But what?

05:23.440 --> 05:24.280
[grunts]

05:24.840 --> 05:25.800
[ringing]

05:27.760 --> 05:28.680
[ringing]

05:30.760 --> 05:33.800
-[ringing]
-What is up, Miss Minnie?

05:33.880 --> 05:36.560
[Minnie] Je T'aime,
I'm on my way to pick you up.

05:36.640 --> 05:39.000
Where are we going?
Are you driving us then?

05:40.080 --> 05:41.920
-[Minnie] Yeah.
-[upbeat music playing on radio]

05:42.000 --> 05:44.120
[Je T'aime] Didn't your dad give you
a 6:00 p.m. curfew?

05:44.200 --> 05:45.360
[Minnie] Screw his curfew.

05:45.440 --> 05:48.000
How could he punish me
when he had no proof? Makes no sense.

05:48.080 --> 05:49.160
[chuckles]

05:49.840 --> 05:50.840
Hm.

05:52.240 --> 05:57.680
Wait, do you think Ploen let me copy
her test answers and ratted me out?

05:57.760 --> 05:59.200
Why would she rat you out?

05:59.280 --> 06:01.960
Is she jealous
that you're richer than her?

06:03.680 --> 06:06.200
Did you send her
the money online or something?

06:06.280 --> 06:08.440
-She might use that as evidence.
-[sniffs]

06:10.120 --> 06:12.440
I didn't. I paid in cash.

06:12.520 --> 06:13.920
[chuckles]

06:14.640 --> 06:18.080
Anyway, it's bullshit the principal
punished you without any proof,

06:18.160 --> 06:19.720
I think that's just fucking wrong.

06:24.480 --> 06:25.520
Right.

06:25.600 --> 06:29.360
That's is exactly why
we're going to forget all this dumb shit

06:29.440 --> 06:31.480
and get blackout-drunk tonight.

06:31.560 --> 06:34.600
-You got that?
-Uh-huh, count me in.

06:34.680 --> 06:36.000
That's the spirit.

06:36.080 --> 06:38.800
I'm about to drive past the school.
I'll be there soon.

06:38.880 --> 06:41.040
-See you then.
-[Je T'aime] Okay. See you.

06:41.120 --> 06:43.280
-Bye.
-Bye, Miss Minnie.

06:46.080 --> 06:47.440
[screams]

06:47.520 --> 06:48.520
[crash]

06:52.440 --> 06:55.240
[rain pattering]

07:05.840 --> 07:07.320
[lightning crackles]

07:26.680 --> 07:30.680
[whimpering]

07:35.160 --> 07:37.760
[gasping]

07:40.880 --> 07:43.480
[tense music playing]

07:44.920 --> 07:45.760
Nanno?

07:51.640 --> 07:53.120
-[brakes screech]
-[crashes]

07:57.320 --> 07:58.160
[gasps]

07:58.240 --> 08:00.120
[sudden music sting]

08:04.680 --> 08:05.720
Ploen.

08:10.720 --> 08:12.120
Minnie.

08:12.200 --> 08:14.000
[gasping]

08:15.320 --> 08:16.760
[Ploen] Help me.

08:19.840 --> 08:21.920
[whimpers]

08:28.040 --> 08:32.240
[Minnie] Do you think Ploen let me copy
her test answers and ratted me out?

08:32.320 --> 08:34.120
[gasping]

08:39.480 --> 08:41.040
[lightning crackles]

08:44.960 --> 08:47.000
[Nanno] Why won't you
help your friend, Minnie?

08:59.560 --> 09:00.600
[exhales]

09:03.880 --> 09:06.520
[chilling music playing]

09:15.400 --> 09:18.240
[gasping]

09:24.920 --> 09:27.080
[sobbing]

09:30.480 --> 09:31.440
[screams]

09:32.040 --> 09:34.400
[sobbing]

09:38.000 --> 09:40.400
Dad, help me, please!

09:40.480 --> 09:41.520
[reporter 1] This just in.

09:41.600 --> 09:45.160
We received a report of a deadly accident
which occurred this evening.

09:45.240 --> 09:47.880
We have learned that a car
has crashed into a school vehicle,

09:47.960 --> 09:50.160
with multiple fatalities.

09:50.240 --> 09:52.920
[reporter 2]
These are the names of the four victims 

09:53.000 --> 09:56.040
who were all 17 and 18-years-old.

09:56.120 --> 09:59.720
It's speculated that the driver
and the four victims are school friends.

09:59.800 --> 10:01.840
Let's go talk to her father now.

10:01.920 --> 10:04.200
Excuse me, are you Minnie's father?

10:05.400 --> 10:08.400
Is your daughter available
for questions about what happened?

10:08.480 --> 10:09.840
I'm sorry.

10:09.920 --> 10:13.080
Uh, my daughter's still in shock

10:13.160 --> 10:14.400
and she's not ready to--

10:15.160 --> 10:16.360
give an interview yet.

10:16.440 --> 10:18.760
[reporter]
Is it because she's been drinking?

10:20.040 --> 10:22.160
There was no alcohol involved.

10:23.040 --> 10:25.880
-None.
-Have the police done a sobriety test?

10:26.800 --> 10:29.880
I told you, my daughter was not drinking.

10:29.960 --> 10:32.160
[reporter] We'll keep you posted
as the story develops.

10:32.240 --> 10:36.400
Judging by the outpour of viewer comments,
this case is gathering national attention.

10:36.480 --> 10:37.320
[TV beeps]

10:42.920 --> 10:45.760
[Songkiat] Do you see what you've done?

10:48.560 --> 10:49.960
I said you were grounded.

10:50.880 --> 10:52.120
Why did you leave?

10:55.120 --> 10:57.640
But I didn't mean for things
to turn out this way.

10:58.400 --> 10:59.640
The brakes…

11:00.440 --> 11:02.680
just… stopped working.

11:02.760 --> 11:03.680
You're lying.

11:04.360 --> 11:05.920
Stop lying to me!

11:08.920 --> 11:12.400
I'm not lying, I'm not.
The brakes weren't working.

11:14.520 --> 11:18.440
She said the brakes were faulty.
Why don't you believe her?

11:20.360 --> 11:21.720
Faulty brakes, huh?

11:22.840 --> 11:27.120
Honey, if I hadn't hid
that bottle of wine…

11:29.560 --> 11:31.000
she'd be in jail right now!

11:31.080 --> 11:33.200
[Minnie's mom scoffs]
Is that true, baby?

11:33.760 --> 11:37.200
But… the brakes really didn't work.
I swear.

11:38.920 --> 11:41.760
What? Do you think I wanted
to run them over with my car?

11:41.840 --> 11:45.080
[Minnie's mom] She's right, honey.
We should be helping her.

11:46.360 --> 11:47.240
No.

11:47.920 --> 11:50.080
I'm tired of cleaning up after this brat.

11:51.360 --> 11:54.960
[sobbing] You have to help me, Dad.

11:58.600 --> 12:00.800
[Songkiat]
A trial will destroy my company's stock.

12:00.880 --> 12:04.800
So your problem has now become mine.

12:05.440 --> 12:06.680
You'll no longer have a life.

12:08.920 --> 12:11.120
-[whimpers]
-[Songkiat] You'll do everything I say.

12:15.720 --> 12:16.880
You understand me?

12:21.040 --> 12:22.920
[sobbing]

12:23.640 --> 12:24.520
[girls whispering]

12:24.600 --> 12:26.240
-Here she comes.
-What is she doing here?

12:26.320 --> 12:27.640
How dare she still come to school?

12:27.720 --> 12:30.320
Oh, wait, I heard
she was drunk last night.

12:30.400 --> 12:32.320
How could she act like nothing happened?

12:32.400 --> 12:35.240
[soft, brooding music playing]

12:55.720 --> 12:58.720
[brooding music continues]

13:15.120 --> 13:16.200
Je T'aime.

13:20.720 --> 13:21.800
[Nanno] Minnie.

13:27.160 --> 13:29.680
[music turns ominous]

13:32.280 --> 13:37.320
This horrible accident happened
because the brakes were faulty.

13:37.400 --> 13:40.840
[Songkiat] Minnie definitely
wasn't drinking and driving.

13:41.520 --> 13:43.400
I can say that with confidence

13:44.760 --> 13:46.160
because…

13:47.080 --> 13:49.400
Minnie has never touched
a drop of alcohol.

13:49.480 --> 13:50.640
[girls whispering]

13:50.720 --> 13:52.040
-That's a lie.
-That's so bullshit.

13:52.120 --> 13:53.800
-Rich girl, that's such a lie.
-Lies!

13:53.880 --> 13:55.280
-I've seen her drunk.
-All the time.

13:55.360 --> 13:57.160
We've seen her drink before.
You've seen her.

13:57.240 --> 13:59.640
The whole school saw her
get wasted and throw up on New Year's.

13:59.720 --> 14:01.680
I bet she'll get away with it anyway.

14:01.760 --> 14:02.840
-Yeah.
-She's, ugh…

14:02.920 --> 14:04.640
Her dad is filthy rich…

14:05.800 --> 14:09.280
Please allow her to prove her innocence.

14:11.000 --> 14:13.280
MINNIE YOU STINKFACE BITCH

14:13.360 --> 14:16.160
YOU KILLED FOUR PEOPLE
AND GOT AWAY WITH IT

14:17.920 --> 14:20.440
[gasping, whimpering]

14:20.520 --> 14:24.400
LET'S STAB HER TO DEATH WITH A FORK
SHE DESERVES TO DIE FOUR TIMES OVER

14:26.400 --> 14:27.680
[gasping]

14:30.960 --> 14:32.320
Ploen was a good girl.

14:33.680 --> 14:35.880
She'd always help me
with chores around the house.

14:36.680 --> 14:38.080
She'd watch the store.

14:39.560 --> 14:41.440
We were hoping she'd take it over.

14:41.520 --> 14:45.880
I want the courts to make a fair judgment
and not side with the culprit.

14:47.280 --> 14:50.880
[reporter] Has Minnie come to apologize
to you for her role in the crash?

14:51.480 --> 14:52.880
She hasn't come here at all.

14:54.160 --> 14:57.120
[reporter] That's the reaction
from one of the four victims' family.

14:57.200 --> 15:00.360
We're closely watching to see
how this trial plays out.

15:00.440 --> 15:03.600
It's yet to be seen
whether this will be, yet again,

15:03.680 --> 15:05.440
another one of those times when the courts

15:05.520 --> 15:08.440
unexpectedly finds
a wealthy minor innocent.

15:13.320 --> 15:15.320
[Songkiat]
I had a lawyer draw up a statement.

15:16.360 --> 15:17.520
Memorize it.

15:26.640 --> 15:29.080
You want me to blame the bus driver
for reckless parking?

15:30.160 --> 15:32.560
Do as I say. Don't argue.

15:37.520 --> 15:39.000
But you know I'm a bad liar.

15:40.040 --> 15:41.880
-[Songkiat laughs]
-[cup clatters]

15:42.960 --> 15:44.000
A bad liar?

15:45.680 --> 15:49.040
You had no trouble lying about your exam.

15:51.080 --> 15:52.320
It's not the same thing.

15:53.480 --> 15:54.480
I can't do this.

15:56.640 --> 15:58.040
But you'll do it.

15:58.760 --> 16:00.800
What you've done makes me…

16:01.680 --> 16:03.520
ashamed to be your father.

16:05.080 --> 16:07.360
[Songkiat]
You want to embarrass me even more?

16:09.640 --> 16:11.000
Do you want that?

16:16.680 --> 16:21.160
THE DEFENDANT HAD BEEN DRIVING

16:21.240 --> 16:23.920
IN A REASONABLY CAREFUL MANNER

16:24.000 --> 16:27.320
[Chopin's "Fantaisie-Impromptu" playing]

16:27.400 --> 16:29.480
THE AREA WAS DESERTED

16:29.560 --> 16:32.400
[inaudible]

16:32.480 --> 16:34.720
THE PLAINTIFF IS TO BLAME
FOR RECKLESSNESS

16:34.800 --> 16:37.120
[inaudible]

16:38.120 --> 16:40.400
[inaudible]

16:46.600 --> 16:49.320
["Fantaisie-Impromptu" continues playing]

16:54.680 --> 16:55.760
[gavel bangs]

16:56.840 --> 16:59.800
How do you feel
about your first testimony?

17:00.960 --> 17:04.000
I'm sorry, she can't say anything now.
It might affect the case.

17:04.080 --> 17:06.520
[cameras flashing]

17:08.400 --> 17:10.120
[bottle rolling]

17:14.440 --> 17:17.640
[girl] Is this the wine
you had that night?

17:24.520 --> 17:27.080
So, did you drink any alcohol that night?

17:28.920 --> 17:31.520
-[reporters clamoring]
-Were you drinking?

17:31.600 --> 17:33.880
Please answer the question.
Answer the question.

17:33.960 --> 17:37.800
-Did you drink any alcohol?
-Were you drinking and driving?

17:37.880 --> 17:39.240
Did you drink any alcohol?

17:39.320 --> 17:41.840
-What will you say to the families?
-Please answer the question.

17:42.720 --> 17:45.640
[ominous music playing]

17:51.000 --> 17:53.840
[dog barking]

17:58.440 --> 18:01.040
[barking continues]

18:07.200 --> 18:09.560
-[gasps]
-[cell phone chimes]

18:19.400 --> 18:23.600
RAISE YOUR HAND IF YOU WANT TO SEE
#MINNIE4CORPSES PAY

18:26.480 --> 18:31.920
LET'S VOTE ON HOW WE SHOULD TEACH
#MINNIE4CORPSES A LESSON

18:32.000 --> 18:34.960
[chilling music playing]

18:35.040 --> 18:36.920
LET'S SLASH HER FACE #MINNIE4CORPSES

18:37.000 --> 18:38.600
SLAP HER TEETH OFF
#MINNIE4CORPSES

18:38.680 --> 18:41.800
I'LL KILL MY KID IF SHE'S A TWAT
LIKE #MINNIE4CORPSES

18:42.880 --> 18:45.520
[cell phone chimes continuously]

18:45.600 --> 18:47.240
KILL HER AND SLASH HER BODY
#MINNIE4CORPSES

18:47.320 --> 18:48.640
SHE DESERVES DEATH #MINNIE4CORPSES

18:49.360 --> 18:50.400
[groans]

18:57.400 --> 18:58.640
[sobs]

18:58.720 --> 18:59.840
[exhales]

19:02.040 --> 19:03.720
[breathing shakily]

19:04.760 --> 19:06.320
[clears throat]

19:29.640 --> 19:32.640
[ominous music playing]

19:49.240 --> 19:52.320
Je T'aime, why are you avoiding me?

19:53.160 --> 19:54.720
I'm not at all.

19:54.800 --> 19:58.280
Please don't lie to me now.
Screw those people who hate me.

19:58.360 --> 20:00.480
You were the one on the phone that night.

20:01.000 --> 20:01.880
But…

20:02.840 --> 20:04.440
[Minnie] But what? Say it.

20:05.000 --> 20:07.880
I remember telling you
that my brakes were faulty.

20:09.560 --> 20:10.880
[Minnie] Do you not believe me?

20:12.640 --> 20:15.200
Je T'aime, you have to believe me.

20:17.520 --> 20:19.480
Uh-huh, I believe you.

20:20.440 --> 20:21.320
But…

20:22.480 --> 20:24.720
-[Je T'aime] But I--
-But you what?

20:24.800 --> 20:26.400
[ominous music playing]

20:26.480 --> 20:27.840
[breathes shakily]

20:27.920 --> 20:29.360
Why won't you tell me?

20:30.360 --> 20:31.960
-[Je T'aime] I see…
-What?

20:33.520 --> 20:34.880
I can see…

20:35.640 --> 20:38.560
four people following you all the time.

20:40.320 --> 20:42.560
[breathing heavily]

20:56.880 --> 21:00.080
[chilling music playing]

21:03.440 --> 21:04.680
[lightning crackles]

21:04.760 --> 21:06.360
-[gasping]
-[engine revving]

21:09.760 --> 21:11.760
[breathing shakily]

21:15.360 --> 21:17.880
[Minnie vomits, chokes]

21:18.760 --> 21:21.320
[coughing, choking]

21:22.040 --> 21:25.640
[whistling
"London Bridge Is Falling Down"]

21:28.360 --> 21:29.600
[door thuds]

21:33.040 --> 21:36.480
[eerie music playing]

21:46.280 --> 21:47.280
[door lock clicks]

21:47.360 --> 21:50.240
[creaking]

22:04.840 --> 22:06.360
[inhales deeply]

22:07.400 --> 22:09.080
[door thuds, clatters]

22:10.400 --> 22:12.880
[eerie music continues]

22:17.000 --> 22:18.280
[pants]

22:21.000 --> 22:23.800
[gasping]

22:25.240 --> 22:27.680
[tense music playing]

22:27.760 --> 22:31.920
[whistling
"London Bridge Is Falling Down"]

22:34.280 --> 22:35.240
Nanno.

22:59.680 --> 23:00.760
The package.

23:02.680 --> 23:04.560
[Yuri] You're as impatient
as your daughter.

23:15.680 --> 23:17.400
[paper rustles]

23:25.440 --> 23:26.360
Are you sure

23:27.040 --> 23:28.560
this is the only copy left?

23:31.320 --> 23:32.320
[Yuri] Mm-hmm.

23:33.280 --> 23:36.880
I don't know how you got these pictures

23:37.720 --> 23:40.200
since I already had the police
delete them.

23:45.520 --> 23:47.800
I'm only paying you once.

23:50.080 --> 23:52.400
If these pictures ever show up again,

23:54.320 --> 23:57.200
I won't be able to guarantee your safety.

24:10.200 --> 24:11.840
[TV beeps]

24:11.920 --> 24:15.040
[man on TV] In the overture
to the opera Marriage of Figaro,

24:15.120 --> 24:17.720
the immortal Austrian composer, Mozart,

24:17.800 --> 24:21.440
plays the violin and the woodwinds
against each other.

24:22.120 --> 24:26.280
[Mozart's "Marriage of Figaro: Overture"
playing on TV]

24:34.560 --> 24:39.000
[reporter] We're continuing our coverage
of the murder suspect known as Minnie.

24:39.080 --> 24:42.560
Her case comes under heavy criticism
as people voice their concern

24:42.640 --> 24:43.880
for the lack of transparency.

24:45.560 --> 24:50.280
If you get away with this,
I swear I will kill you myself.

24:50.360 --> 24:53.360
[chilling music playing]

24:53.440 --> 24:55.400
[cackling]

24:55.480 --> 24:56.880
[gasps]

24:58.440 --> 25:00.560
-Why won't you help your friend, Minnie?
-Help me.

25:02.880 --> 25:04.600
-[Nanno chuckles]
-[Minnie gasping]

25:09.240 --> 25:11.560
[panting]

25:15.600 --> 25:18.600
[whistling
"London Bridge Is Falling Down"]

25:20.480 --> 25:21.600
[screams]

25:23.280 --> 25:24.760
[whistling stops]

25:27.760 --> 25:28.600
[yells]

25:28.680 --> 25:30.680
[birds cawing]

25:37.400 --> 25:39.040
I see those four victims…

25:40.720 --> 25:42.520
following me all the time.

25:42.600 --> 25:45.040
[eerie music playing]

25:46.080 --> 25:47.880
[Minnie] I can't stand it anymore, Mom.

25:51.040 --> 25:52.640
[Minnie's mom] Calm down, honey.

25:54.440 --> 25:56.080
You're just imagining it.

25:58.160 --> 26:01.480
You told me the brakes were faulty.
The brakes stopped working.

26:06.720 --> 26:08.120
It's not your fault.

26:08.880 --> 26:11.480
The mob blames you,
so now, you blame yourself.

26:13.000 --> 26:16.400
We should really be focusing
on the trial right now.

26:18.000 --> 26:20.760
Just do as your dad says, okay?

26:33.040 --> 26:36.840
[Bach's "Komm, Jesu, Komm" playing]

26:58.520 --> 27:01.800
[reporter] We have an update
on the case that's captivated the nation.

27:01.880 --> 27:04.440
Today, the Juvenile Court
has delivered the verdict

27:04.520 --> 27:06.680
on the Minnie and The Four Corpses case.

27:06.760 --> 27:09.880
Both parties are charged
with involuntary manslaughter.

27:10.640 --> 27:13.000
The school vehicle was parked
in a hazardous spot

27:13.080 --> 27:16.120
which could have potentially
caused an accident.

27:16.200 --> 27:19.720
Minnie has been sentenced to pay
ten grand in restitution

27:19.800 --> 27:21.960
to each of the victims' families.

27:23.240 --> 27:24.240
In addition to that,

27:24.320 --> 27:27.800
she must also complete
300 hours of community service.

27:31.240 --> 27:33.480
[booing, jeering]

27:33.560 --> 27:36.200
-Yeah, "deserve to live".
-You've got blood on your hands, girl.

27:36.280 --> 27:39.840
[overlapping clamoring]

27:41.160 --> 27:43.560
["Komm, Jesu, Komm" continues playing]

27:46.120 --> 27:48.920
[woman] Murderer! Murderer!

27:49.520 --> 27:51.240
[woman] You people…

27:51.880 --> 27:54.440
you deserve to be killed!

27:54.520 --> 27:56.360
-[thudding]
-[woman] We're coming for you.

27:56.440 --> 27:58.360
We're coming for you!

28:00.400 --> 28:03.520
Don't be afraid, honey. It's okay.

28:14.040 --> 28:15.800
[Nanno] It was your fault.

28:15.880 --> 28:17.160
[chuckles]

28:17.240 --> 28:18.240
You're a murderer.

28:18.320 --> 28:20.360
Do you think you can run from me?
Murderer.

28:20.440 --> 28:22.720
-You killed them. It's your fault.
-I'm innocent.

28:22.800 --> 28:24.600
-What's the matter?
-I'm innocent, innocent.

28:24.680 --> 28:25.880
-What's the matter?
-Innocent!

28:25.960 --> 28:27.200
-[Nanno] Murderer.
-Minnie!

28:30.680 --> 28:31.880
[Minnie's mom] What's wrong?

28:33.680 --> 28:37.080
Ma'am, the brakes. They're not working!

28:37.160 --> 28:38.520
[all gasp]

28:39.920 --> 28:40.800
[screeching]

28:40.880 --> 28:43.640
-[driver grunting]
-[all whimpering]

28:43.720 --> 28:45.040
-[all scream]
-[crashes]

28:51.160 --> 28:52.520
[wheels rolling]

28:58.120 --> 28:59.840
[sudden music sting]

29:05.560 --> 29:07.400
[lightning crackles]

29:09.000 --> 29:10.800
[rain pattering]

29:13.080 --> 29:14.120
[gasps]

29:20.680 --> 29:22.440
[lightning crackles]

29:29.400 --> 29:30.400
[gasps]

29:31.120 --> 29:33.480
Welcome to everybody's favorite game,

29:33.560 --> 29:37.560
Raise Your Hand If You Want to See
Minnie Four Corpses Pay!

29:39.760 --> 29:43.320
[Nanno] Do you know there are lots
of people who want to see you rot in jail?

29:43.400 --> 29:45.400
You're the most famous person alive.

29:47.440 --> 29:49.760
Start the game!

29:53.160 --> 29:54.120
Hey.

29:54.200 --> 29:56.680
[chilling music playing]

29:56.760 --> 29:57.920
Who the hell are you?

30:00.200 --> 30:02.960
[Nanno] They're just the people
who want to see you get punished.

30:04.120 --> 30:07.440
Do you know how many people in the world
want to see you dead?

30:08.840 --> 30:09.800
All right.

30:09.880 --> 30:12.280
Are you ready to hear the verdict
from the audience at home?

30:13.920 --> 30:15.360
Coming in fourth place,

30:15.440 --> 30:18.720
"Break Minnie's legs
for not hitting the brakes,

30:18.800 --> 30:21.120
-the real cause of this tragedy."
-[whimpers]

30:22.880 --> 30:24.840
Okay. Do it!

30:25.880 --> 30:27.040
Ouch!

30:27.120 --> 30:28.600
[whimpers]

30:32.040 --> 30:33.640
-[bone cracks]
-[yelps]

30:35.000 --> 30:36.800
-[bone cracks]
-[cries]

30:37.760 --> 30:39.480
[shushes]

30:39.560 --> 30:41.080
[sobbing]

30:41.160 --> 30:42.960
-[bone cracks]
-[cries]

30:44.320 --> 30:45.440
[squelching]

30:45.520 --> 30:48.320
[screaming]

30:51.600 --> 30:53.840
[sobbing]

30:54.600 --> 30:55.920
[Nanno] Let's continue.

30:56.000 --> 30:57.560
Coming in third place,

30:58.640 --> 31:00.720
this one wants to knock all your teeth out

31:00.800 --> 31:03.560
for being a selfish, shameless liar.

31:03.640 --> 31:04.840
Let's see that now!

31:06.520 --> 31:08.840
-[thudding]
-[Minnie screaming]

31:14.280 --> 31:17.760
Her teeth still haven't fallen out
after all that slapping.

31:17.840 --> 31:19.640
Should we try something else on you?

31:21.120 --> 31:23.720
-[thudding]
-[Minnie groaning]

31:28.440 --> 31:30.640
[muffled whimpering]

31:36.920 --> 31:38.360
[breathing shakily]

31:44.560 --> 31:45.800
[squelches]

31:45.880 --> 31:48.040
[whimpering]

31:48.120 --> 31:50.160
All your teeth have fallen out.

31:51.880 --> 31:53.800
But you're still alive, aren't you?

31:53.880 --> 31:57.080
We can't move on to the next pick
if you're not dead.

31:57.160 --> 31:58.520
[Nanno] Hmm…

31:59.880 --> 32:02.440
[chilling music playing]

32:10.920 --> 32:12.440
Let's go!

32:13.360 --> 32:14.200
[thuds]

32:21.640 --> 32:24.040
-[rain pattering]
-[lightning crackles]

32:32.440 --> 32:33.800
[Nanno] Ta-da!

32:33.880 --> 32:34.880
[Minnie] What?

32:34.960 --> 32:36.840
Don't look so shocked.

32:36.920 --> 32:38.600
We're only onto the second place winner.

32:39.360 --> 32:41.880
This one is from Ploen's parents.

32:43.600 --> 32:45.760
Come on down!

32:45.840 --> 32:48.040
[lightning crackles]

32:51.360 --> 32:53.880
[ominous music playing]

32:55.280 --> 32:56.400
You were wrong.

32:57.400 --> 32:59.160
But you won't admit, will you?

33:00.760 --> 33:03.120
It's not my fault. Please, believe me.

33:07.040 --> 33:09.160
I'm innocent. I'm innocent.

33:12.120 --> 33:14.400
I'm innocent! I'm innocent! I'm innocent!

33:14.480 --> 33:17.040
I'm-- [screams]

33:18.440 --> 33:20.840
I'm innocent! I'm innocent!

33:20.920 --> 33:22.920
-[screams]
-[squelching]

33:23.000 --> 33:25.400
-[laughing]
-[squelching]

33:26.040 --> 33:27.960
I'm innocent! I'm innocent!

33:28.040 --> 33:29.760
-[Minnie] No!
-[Nanno laughing]

33:29.840 --> 33:31.480
[Minnie screaming]

33:32.200 --> 33:34.400
[gasps, pants]

33:39.000 --> 33:41.920
[panting]

33:59.320 --> 34:01.840
[dog barking]

34:06.040 --> 34:09.240
[lightning crackles]

34:09.320 --> 34:11.760
[chilling music playing]

34:14.800 --> 34:16.600
[panting]

34:16.680 --> 34:17.720
Dad.

34:17.800 --> 34:20.360
Someone's coming to kill us.
We have to go.

34:21.200 --> 34:24.280
There's no need, Minnie. It's all over.

34:25.040 --> 34:26.320
We're finally free.

34:27.240 --> 34:29.000
[breathing shakily]

34:32.120 --> 34:33.200
Are you sure?

34:34.600 --> 34:35.680
Of course.

34:36.320 --> 34:38.760
Now, give me a hug. Don't be scared.

34:39.680 --> 34:42.040
All right? Don't be afraid.

34:44.760 --> 34:47.120
No one's gonna hurt you.

34:48.160 --> 34:51.040
[Songkiat chuckling]

34:56.960 --> 34:58.240
[choking]

34:58.320 --> 34:59.840
-Dad.
-[Songkiat grunts]

34:59.920 --> 35:01.680
Dad, I can't breathe!

35:01.760 --> 35:04.360
-Dad. Dad, let me go.
-[Songkiat grunting]

35:04.440 --> 35:05.920
[Minnie] Dad!

35:07.480 --> 35:11.480
[whistling
"London Bridge Is Falling Down"]

35:11.560 --> 35:12.960
[whimpering]

35:14.480 --> 35:17.280
Hm. Do you understand now, Minnie?

35:17.840 --> 35:21.160
The only one who's hurting you
is your own father.

35:21.960 --> 35:23.240
-[Nanno] Now.
-[Songkiat grunting]

35:23.320 --> 35:25.480
The first place prize goes to,

35:25.560 --> 35:29.640
"Strangling my bratty daughter
for causing trouble every damn day."

35:30.320 --> 35:34.520
That's from Mr. Songkiat,
Minnie's very wealthy father!

35:34.600 --> 35:37.360
[sobbing] Dad, let me go!

35:37.440 --> 35:39.520
-Dad!
-[grunts]

35:40.600 --> 35:43.600
-[Songkiat grunting]
-[choking]

35:43.680 --> 35:46.040
-[screaming]
-[Songkiat grunting]

35:46.120 --> 35:47.400
[bottle shatters]

35:50.600 --> 35:52.920
[brooding music playing]

35:56.040 --> 35:57.960
[Songkiat grunts]

35:58.040 --> 35:59.160
[choking]

36:02.120 --> 36:04.560
-[Songkiat grunting]
-[choking]

36:05.120 --> 36:09.280
Don't be afraid, Minnie.
It will only hurt a little.

36:11.240 --> 36:13.280
[choking]

36:13.360 --> 36:14.480
[weakly] Dad…

36:16.280 --> 36:17.920
-[Songkiat grunting]
-[choking]

36:21.360 --> 36:24.880
[chokes, gasping]

36:42.520 --> 36:45.280
[beeping]

36:45.360 --> 36:47.360
[lighting crackles]

36:52.320 --> 36:55.600
[beeping continues]

37:03.440 --> 37:05.280
[tongue clicking]

37:07.000 --> 37:09.960
[ominous music playing]

37:22.880 --> 37:24.600
How are you feeling, Minnie?

37:28.000 --> 37:29.880
[sighs]

37:29.960 --> 37:32.200
If you had owned up to what you did
from the start,

37:33.160 --> 37:35.080
none of this would've happened.

37:36.920 --> 37:39.960
[panting]

37:40.040 --> 37:42.560
[Nanno] But you've only died two times.

37:46.000 --> 37:47.240
[whimpering softly]

37:48.840 --> 37:50.320
Are you tired yet?

37:51.080 --> 37:53.240
[breathing heavily]

37:56.880 --> 37:58.880
You get some rest tonight.

38:02.120 --> 38:04.960
[panting]

38:10.680 --> 38:11.840
[door closes]

38:18.840 --> 38:19.960
[elevator bell dings]

38:28.840 --> 38:29.840
[door opens]

38:29.920 --> 38:33.480
[Yuri humming
"London Bridge Is Falling Down"]

38:37.640 --> 38:40.280
[Yuri] Oh, wow. There's a TV here.

38:41.880 --> 38:42.960
How nice.

38:49.200 --> 38:51.160
-[sighs]
-[TV beeps]

38:51.240 --> 38:54.360
[reporter] In today's news,
key evidence has just been found.

38:55.480 --> 38:59.040
We believe it will lead the police
to reopen the investigation

38:59.120 --> 39:01.760
of the case of Minnie Four Corpses.

39:01.840 --> 39:04.600
An anonymous source
has sent these pictures

39:04.680 --> 39:07.160
to our station this morning.
Let's take a look at them together.

39:07.240 --> 39:09.960
[tense music playing]

39:13.800 --> 39:15.840
MINNIE FOUR CORPSES CASE TO REOPEN
KEY EVIDENCE FOUND

39:15.920 --> 39:19.120
[reporter] Besides the pictures that
you're seeing, there's also an audio clip.

39:19.200 --> 39:22.240
The voice in the clip
allegedly belongs to Mr. Songkiat,

39:22.320 --> 39:23.760
who is Minnie's father.

39:23.840 --> 39:26.000
It appears that he was threatening
this anonymous person

39:26.080 --> 39:29.080
not to leak the photos
that we are currently showing you.

39:31.200 --> 39:33.520
[Songkiat] I'm only paying you once.

39:33.600 --> 39:35.800
If these pictures ever show up again,

39:36.400 --> 39:39.280
I won't be able to guarantee your safety.

39:41.080 --> 39:42.280
[Yuri] From now on,

39:43.000 --> 39:44.600
Mr. Songkiat…

39:46.200 --> 39:48.800
won't be able to help out
his precious daughter.

39:52.560 --> 39:54.920
[Yuri]
There's only one way to end this hell.

39:57.160 --> 39:58.200
It's this.

40:05.520 --> 40:07.680
[sobbing]

40:09.640 --> 40:11.200
[Yuri chuckles]

40:12.880 --> 40:18.160
[Yuri humming
"London Bridge Is Falling Down"]

40:20.840 --> 40:21.920
[groans softly]

40:23.800 --> 40:27.600
[humming continues]

40:43.960 --> 40:45.720
[Yuri] What a beautiful night.

40:57.480 --> 41:00.640
[ominous music playing]

41:11.520 --> 41:12.440
[thuds]

41:35.280 --> 41:36.600
[elevator bell dings]

41:38.520 --> 41:40.920
[Yuri] We meet again, Nanno.

41:44.720 --> 41:46.040
So, it's you, Yuri.

41:51.720 --> 41:53.800
[chuckling]

41:53.880 --> 41:55.080
Surprise.

41:57.320 --> 41:59.800
[haunting music playing]

42:03.320 --> 42:04.880
[lightning crackles]

42:09.000 --> 42:11.800
[haunting music continues]

42:24.600 --> 42:26.720
[closing theme music playing]
